    "Overbright can’t run next to another brightness app on the color table. Use Compatibility mode on a display to run alongside it." : {
      "comment" : "Settings ▸ Advanced: note under a running brightness app",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Overbright can’t run next to another brightness app on the color table. Use Compatibility mode on a display to run alongside it."
