    "The idea behind Compatibility mode: a full-screen overlay that multiplies the picture. No code was copied." : {
      "comment" : "Settings ▸ About ▸ Acknowledgments: what Overbright learned from xdr-boost",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "The idea behind Compatibility mode: a full-screen overlay that multiplies the picture. No code was copied."
